# The ragnar DuckDB store IS committed: in the default BM25/FTS mode it is a
# small (~4.5 MB), deterministic, zero-dependency artifact, so committing it
# makes the example turnkey — clone, renv::restore(), run, with no build step
# and no external services. scripts/build_ragnar_store.R remains the recipe to
# regenerate it (or to build the larger semantic 'vss' variant).
#
# Only DuckDB's transient write-ahead / temp files are ignored.
data/*.duckdb.wal
data/*.duckdb.tmp/
